  "name": "Example: Finding the Transpose of a Row Vector or Column Vector",
  "problem": "If\n    ${A} = \n    \\left\\lbrack\n    \\matrix {\n        5 & -1 & 0 \\\n    }\n    \\right\\rbrack,$\nthen what is ${A^T} ?$",
